==German==

====Alternative spellings====
*[[Scheisse]] {{italbrac|Switzerland}}

===Etymology===
{{MHG.|de}} ''schīze'', originally *''schīte'', from a Germanic root ''*skeit-a-'', this from an Indo-European root ''*skei-d-'' with the meaning "to [[part]]" (as in {{Gr.}} ''Σχιστός'').

===Noun===
'''Scheiße''' {{f}}

# {{vulgar|lang=de}} [[shit]]
#: ''Wo ich hintrete nur '''Scheiße'''!''
# {{context|vulgar|figuratively|lang=de}} [[shit]]
#: ''Das ist doch alles '''Scheiße'''!''

